  join(",\n", [
    "[" ++ join(",", [show(dice[d,i]) | i in 1..s]) ++ "]"
    | d in 1..n
  ]),
  "]"
];
```
This model finds five dice, each with `s` faces, such that the "beats" relationships between dice match the Rock-Paper-Scissors-Lizard-Spock structure. The output is a list of lists, where each sublist is a die.

